**What Works RIGHT NOW:**
- `chaperone run --config chaperone.toml` starts proxy server on port 4010
- HTTPS requests tunnel transparently to upstream servers
- Multiple concurrent tunnels work without interference
- Graceful shutdown with SIGTERM/SIGINT
