- `env` provider: LOW (simple os.Getenv)
- `file` provider: LOW (os.ReadFile with permission checks)
- `keychain` provider: HIGH (OS-specific, requires external library)
- `command` provider: MEDIUM (exec.Command with security considerations)
- `vault` provider: HIGH (HTTP client, authentication, KV2 API)

